# Clock with no CLOCK.INI: 3.11 starts it digital with seconds and the date, 9:30:03 (Clock starts on
# the second after ARCH311_CLOCK) - as arch311-ref/scn/clock-def.scn, frame 01.
# KNOWN DIFFERENCE (max 10): the time and date are TrueType Arial (28 and 21 pixels per em); glyph
# positions and metrics match 3.11, but 10 pixels on diagonal outline edges differ from 3.1's own
# scan converter (3 in "9:30:03 AM", 7 in "10/8/26").
# regress: ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:02" sh apps/clock/tests/clock.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: clock-def/01.png 01-default.png ignore 320 240 333 261 max 10
sleep 150
shot shots/01-default.png
quit
